{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本多地繼續受強烈寒流影響，過千人被困。</p><p></p><p>在福島縣裡磐梯地區，因大雪令樹木倒塌阻塞公路，令900多名居民，以及約500名旅客被困，當局後來打通一條行車線，讓旅客陸續離開。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.WEATHER-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wkkU4CdJ8h1795353879.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>據報有數百戶停電，旅館因暖氣中斷，要發放毛毯給住客使用，餐廳要點蠟燭，區內亦無法接收手機信號，後來電力供應恢復。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.WEATHER-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026L4o4oDcdKp1795353922.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.WEATHER-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MNHltKeX0k1795353935.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:03:54.199402+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T02:17:14.547267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:57:19.716922+00:00","content_hash":"cb5841845f13767a0446398b0a2636cafa3dd82d01289cc57be7984cfaebfbe2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:03:54.199402+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}